  AlwaysAvailable: "That audio play you put on the radio yesterday was sick! Could
    you put on more? @SozanCinephile \r\nLord, please attend the Soza city annual
    kite flying festival. Your presence and breath will be a great boon to its success!
    @Kiel \r\nOh Great Ram, we wish you could visit our city! @MineIs5thWoolStreetBTW\r\nGreat
    Ram, please direct your attention to East Soza in two days! We're holding a parade!
    @ILoveA\r\nWe're almost done adding spirals to all the rooftops for you! I hope
    you find them hypnotizing! @LilUzu\r\nLord overhead, we added amplifiers to our
    concert hall in hopes that you'll hear us! @Baaaach\r\nI painted a mural of you!
    Please look at it, I live on 71st Horn street on the 66th floor! I know it's
    hard to see, but I made it as big as I could! @ArtistAardvark\r\nI am trying
    to capture your splendor in a painting but I keep running out of grey paint trying
    to depict your hugeness. Please smite those who do not carry enough of thine
    divine pigment!! @TheMostBestFan"
